# honghueasystudy
===
 Honghu Yixue is a browser extension that helps college students complete online classes and assignments efficiently and free up time. It supports mainstream online course platforms such as Chaoxing, Wisdom Tree, Vocational Education Cloud, Rain Classroom, Chinese University MOOC, and U Campus, and has built-in AI question answering capabilities. It provides automatic learning, forced double-speed playback, homework assistance, AI answering questions, customized question bank configuration, and can be connected to mainstream large models. The latest version releases a desktop application, which supports automatic injection of extensions into multiple browsers, batch brushing of courses and questions, centralized management, and supports automatic anti-detection operations for Wisdom Tree/MOOC. Wisdom Tree/MOOC needs to install the desktop side to use all functions. ..
